","text":"あァ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、最近アニメ見てなくってわからんぜなので握手会なのでアニメの話皆さんが教えてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊好きなスポーツは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→これ私に聞きますか笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運動大嫌いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"100m走るだけで疲れちゃう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"50mが精一杯の範囲です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、レッスンレッスンなので体力もついてきたかなーって感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに50m10秒くらいかかるよw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊蘭世って読んでいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もちろんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんらんもいいんですが蘭世って言う珍しい名前なのでぜひ、蘭世って読んでください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世です＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、初めてお会いした方に名前を言うと皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一回いいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなるんですよーw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ´ー｀)フゥー．．．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊尊敬してる先輩は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→齋藤 飛鳥さんです！"},{"type"